{"data": [{"author_id": "2022929699845128192", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:33:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009761506836633"], "id": "2125009761506836633", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI Agent 对于 #现代婚姻 造成了什么影响？\n\n我前两天和一个朋友吃饭，他们两口子都是计算机专家。我朋友吐槽说，有了 Grok Bot 、Muse ，另一半安排了更多家庭活动，包括以前根本想不起来的庆祝的事儿🎉，这点很贴心。\n\n但是人味更淡了。\n\n就是反正是 agent 提醒，agent", "url": "https://x.com/yzhao010/status/2125009761506836633"}, {"author_id": "15522250", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:32:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009744414830787"], "id": "2125009744414830787", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1917314618", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124967806206648768", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ScottCharles_ @wholemars It’s great at architecture/design and planning — for automation/code. Great at solving complex issues and producing at scale without creating new problems. I use it for all my apps (device and web). I notice it solves quicker than grok bot too.", "url": "https://x.com/stanislaw81/status/2125009744414830787"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2125009635551916032"]}, "author_id": "2116318024198426624", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:32:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009700509176169"], "id": "2125009700509176169", "in_reply_to_user_id": "417508671", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124894514796286096", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thesimaximalist @grok @bot @realDonaldTrump @elonmusk @nvidia @JensenHuang @Trump @WhiteHouse https://t.co/bdH9mDV4Kc", "url": "https://x.com/Xx0709AI/status/2125009700509176169"}, {"author_id": "2113842436212723712", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:32:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009693596889112"], "id": "2125009693596889112", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Our Grok Bot browser crashed at 6am. Now it fixes itself.\n\nWhen an automation browser hangs, it should come back by itself without wiping logins. This script checks the process, display and CDP, then restarts the same profile. A lock blocks overlapping runs, it tries three times,", "url": "https://x.com/OutworkVentures/status/2125009693596889112"}, {"author_id": "1419111531623575556", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:32:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009652631138718"], "id": "2125009652631138718", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1574488912545955855", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124830963679244741", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Jamesf87F @grok @bot Making butter 😋", "url": "https://x.com/NathanAMeeks/status/2125009652631138718"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2125009631818792960", "3_2125009635308392448"]}, "author_id": "467940513", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:32:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009147984793798", "2125009305414054024", "2125009638579962312"], "id": "2125009638579962312", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Big discrepancy in costs to upgrade Grok bot to Super. On laptop versus on phone. \n\n@elonmusk\nHow does this happen? https://t.co/PuXSdjBDH2", "url": "https://x.com/Perfectly_Laura/status/2125009638579962312"}, {"author_id": "218611473", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:32:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009634037813638"], "id": "2125009634037813638", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1584047843030990848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2124996870816866792", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@VadimStrizheus Grok Bot is the one on my list doing real work. I run about a dozen agents on it, from my photo business inbox to my calendar to research for X. Giving each one a single job is what made it click.", "url": "https://x.com/andybarnhart/status/2125009634037813638"}, {"author_id": "1913576862053523456", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:32:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009608125403203"], "id": "2125009608125403203", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "xAI의 자율 AI 에이전트 '그록 봇(Grok Bot)', 전화 걸기 기능 탑재 및 24시간 클라우드 업무 자동화로 직장인·기업 활용 급증 https://t.co/ul93UMHz9E", "url": "https://x.com/fivetilnews/status/2125009608125403203"}, {"author_id": "1893669580268097536", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:32:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009570728903011"], "id": "2125009570728903011", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2125005873198067910", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @elonmusk Why does it apply only to top brass and leaderships? Why doesn’t it apply to every employee then? It’s just fucking hypocrisy. And you have been trained to become a racist hypocrite bot. We need regulations around it. No AI should be racist or feminist", "url": "https://x.com/sikka_hitesh/status/2125009570728903011"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2125007223604789248", "3_2125007508259602432"]}, "author_id": "1496696244797804544", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:32:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009538898395184"], "id": "2125009538898395184", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "深受读者喜欢的《纽约时报》今天爆出一篇文章说明 $SPCX 在AI发展面临的困境\n\n读下来，有点跟google类似，就是宝贵的算力资源用来训练大模型，还是对外租赁。 https://t.co/FdoJG0Hgh3", "url": "https://x.com/FelixYangA8/status/2125009538898395184"}, {"author_id": "1896204225232904192", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:32:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009535744241682"], "id": "2125009535744241682", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "xAI의 자율 AI 에이전트 '그록 봇(Grok Bot)', 전화 걸기 기능 탑재 및 24시간 클라우드 업무 자동화로 직장인·기업 활용 급증 https://t.co/vCcPMj6jzC", "url": "https://x.com/studioburb/status/2125009535744241682"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2125009529024946176"]}, "author_id": "101584084", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:32:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009532011282453"], "id": "2125009532011282453", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 786, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2125007479730008336", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Over 90% Of Local Businesses Don’t Know About Grok Bot.\n\nThe Opportunity\n\nSmall business owners (all 36.2 million of them) do not have the time to learn Al. They want to pay someone they trust locally to install and manage a tireless digital worker.\n\nLearn how for free below: https://t.co/E4resl3XiT https://t.co/zorC0I2QkW", "url": "https://x.com/BrianRoemmele/status/2125009532011282453"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2125008877427253248"]}, "author_id": "1428195201206554635", "created_at": "2026-11-23T23:31:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2125009495252402545"], "id": "2125009495252402545", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Thought I was going crazy for a second and thought Grok @bot was talking about